        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>INOX FH22PD8440, Round Luna Privacy Pocket Door Hardware</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Round Luna Pocket Door Privacy Set comes as a set of two flush pulls and a privacy mortise box that has a retractable finger edge pull for getting the door from the pocket. The Luna Pocket Door Hardware Set adds a level of privacy to sliding pocket doors leading into bedrooms or bathrooms. The thrumbturn on the inside throws and retracts the latch. On the outside flush pull, their is an emergency release (coin release). \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Pocket Door Privacy Lock:</b> Locks but has access to unlock from the outside via emergency turn. Privacy locks do not offer security, they offer privacy.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/round-luna-pocket-door-passage-set-inox-fh22pd8010\"><b>Passage Set</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/round-luna-pocket-door-keyed-entry-inox-fh22pd8450\"><b>Keyed Entry Function</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Luna Sliding Door Trim:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass or Stainless</li>\r\n<li>Face Plate Diameter: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Plate Projection: 5/64\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Height: 5-29/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Width: 11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Depth: 3-41/64\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Face Plate Height: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Face Plate Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\", 2\", 2-1/4\", 2-3/4\", or 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Backset: 2-3/4\", 2-1/2\", or 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Finger Pull: is thrown by pressing the button on the mortise's face plate. It can be retracted simply by pressing it flush with the faceplate.</li>\r\n<li>Non-handed</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/INX-FH22PD8440-specifications.pdf?v=1704262379\"><b>INOX FH22PD8440 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Set:</b> two (2) flush pulls, a privacy mortise, and all mounting hardware. <b>For One (1) Door.</b>\r\n</p>",
